Subject: build the selection-range provider without Flow's server

Issue: ubugeeei-prod/uf#1381
Upstream: not filed yet
Submodule: 81b0c2a3dd591c66c51167aac341d851932bd9c5

`textDocument/selectionRange` is Flow's `selection_range_provider`, an AST
walk. Patch 0015 put that module behind the `server` feature because it
imported `flow_server_env`. The two helpers it used are a position
conversion `flow_lsp` already has and a three-line range constructor, so
the module no longer needs the server stack and is built with the document
symbol provider.

Delete this when upstream splits the provider from the server.

